5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should check if the gallery can actually handle the proposals before we decide.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Agreed. We should look at what actually brings people back, not just what looks good on paper.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,And who is going to do the work! We can't just forget about the people.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to know why things always go wrong with the deliveries. We need to be sure!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A rational approach would be to identify where our budget vanishes. I suggest we audit the hidden costs.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, do you think the building's limits are as important as the money?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Both are practicalities. But visitor data is the only way to measure true success.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"But if the staff are too tired, the visitors won't be happy anyway!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Exactly! If the art doesn't even arrive on time, nobody sees it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Kenji. Logistics and budgets are the twin pillars of a disaster if ignored.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look into the structural survey and the evening bookings.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the head counts and the visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm checking the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll take the lender paperwork and the transport costs.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the mount-making charges and the maintenance logs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
