35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The floor has strict limits... and the evening events make the room very crowded.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,It seems people prefer interactive or living displays over static objects in cases.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The lab is totally overwhelmed! We have almost no one to prepare the items.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Shipping is a nightmare. Costs are huge and the paperwork often arrives too late.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Powered displays are a liability for maintenance, and custom mounts are becoming far too expensive.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin, if the lab is full, we can't have an exhibition that needs a lot of cleaning.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, does that mean we should avoid the high-tech options despite the visitor interest?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,Yes! We need something that doesn't add to the backlog or require a huge team.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,And we should avoid anything with too many distant loans. It's too risky.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. We need a balance between attraction and operational sustainability.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,We also can't put anything too heavy in the suspended bay.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"So we need something engaging, but simple to install and maintain.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,Something where the volunteers can actually help without needing a degree in conservation.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"Local items would be best. No shipping delays, no massive courier bills.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. Minimizing bespoke joinery and electronic failures is the logical path.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
