60,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Candidate A seems safest for the floor. B and D might be too heavy or complex.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"A has the demonstration sessions. That matches the visitor desire for ""people"" in the gallery.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,A uses local craftspeople. That takes the pressure off our conservation lab!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Kenji,,A is local! No shipping cut-offs or expensive international crates to worry about.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,A avoids the powered display failures of D and the mount costs of B.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, do you think the demonstrations will interfere with the evening hire?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,Not if they are scheduled. It's better than the static nature of B.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,I love A. It's the only one that doesn't make me worry about the staff.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"B is too risky with the loans. C is okay, but A is better for logistics.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"C's working bench is interesting, but A is the most fiscally responsible choice.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm comfortable with A. It's the least intrusive for the building.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I'll vote for A. It satisfies the public's appetite for engagement.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,A it is! Let's give the staff a break.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm with you all. A is the only one that won't end in apologies.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,The logic is sound. A minimizes risk across all our identified constraints.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
